# Foundry build output. lib/ is a git submodule and is tracked as one, so that
# `forge test` works from a fresh clone after `git submodule update --init`.
contracts/out/
contracts/cache/
# Written for one `forge inspect` by script/prove-and-verify-on-arc.mjs and
# removed in the same run; ignored so a crashed run leaves no surprise.
contracts/src/generated/
contracts/broadcast/
broadcast/
contracts/deployments/31337.json
contracts/deployments/*.dry-run.json
contracts/deployments/5042002.local.json
# Soroban build output. Compiled Wasm is never committed: a deployment record
# carries each Wasm's sha256, and `stellar contract build` reproduces the bytes
# from the pinned toolchain and Cargo.lock (docs/decisions/stellar-target.md).
# Every Cargo workspace under contracts/ writes its own, vendored ones included.
contracts/target/
contracts/**/target/
# soroban-sdk testutils writes a ledger snapshot per test; the tests are the record.
contracts/**/test_snapshots/
*.wasm
.vercel
